### Phase 10 — demo HTTP collection for the GreenV Vegetation Prediction API.
### Works with VS Code's "REST Client" extension or IntelliJ's HTTP client.
### Start the server first: uvicorn greenv_vegpred.api.app:app --app-dir src --port 8000
### All data returned is synthetic (data_provenance: "synthetic") -- see reports/api.md.

@host = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Health -- never runs a prediction, just reports what's loaded.
GET {{host}}/health

### Operational summary, computed from the current snapshot (not hard-coded).
GET {{host}}/api/v1/summary

### Top-5 ranking by urgency (critical -> forecast by soonest -> beyond_horizon -> insufficient_data).
GET {{host}}/api/v1/forecasts/ranking?limit=5

### Full ranking (all 118 trechos in the current snapshot).
GET {{host}}/api/v1/forecasts/ranking

### List forecasts, filtered by status (transparent equality filter, no query language).
GET {{host}}/api/v1/forecasts?status=forecast

### List forecasts, filtered by operational_status.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/forecasts?operational_status=not-ready

### One trecho's forecast (replace with a real trecho_id from the ranking response above).
GET {{host}}/api/v1/forecasts/SP-021:norte:000000

### A trecho_id that does not exist -> 404.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/forecasts/SP-021:norte:999999

### Dynamic inference, valid request, height below threshold (needs the frozen model).
POST {{host}}/api/v1/forecasts/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trecho_id": "demo:001",
  "as_of_date": "2026-09-10",
  "height_cm": 15.96,
  "height_prev_cm": 13.2,
  "weekly_growth_cm": 2.76,
  "days_since_rocada": 42,
  "gdd_week_tb15_c": 38.5,
  "tmin_week_c": 17.2,
  "rain_30d_mm": 64.0,
  "water_deficit_30d": -12.5,
  "operational_status": "ready"
}

### Dynamic inference, height already at/above threshold -> deterministic, no model needed.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/forecasts/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trecho_id": "demo:002",
  "as_of_date": "2026-09-10",
  "height_cm": 35.0
}

### Dynamic inference, INVALID: an extra/forbidden field -> 422 (never accepted, not even ignored).
POST {{host}}/api/v1/forecasts/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trecho_id": "demo:003",
  "as_of_date": "2026-09-10",
  "height_cm": 10.0,
  "true_height_cm": 999.0
}

### Dynamic inference, INVALID: missing the one required field -> 422.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/forecasts/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trecho_id": "demo:004",
  "as_of_date": "2026-09-10"
}

### OpenAPI JSON (matches api/openapi.v1.yaml) and interactive docs.
GET {{host}}/openapi.json

### GET {{host}}/docs
